<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 60 0 R/E(William of Orange, the father of the Dutch nation, lived and died in Delft. He is buried in the Nieuwe Kerk, where nearly every member of the Dutch royal family has been laid to rest since.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

