277 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 60 0 R/E(The tower of the Oude Kerk, affectionately called \217Scheve Jan\220 \(Leaning Jan\), leans almost two metres. It was built on a filled-in canal and started tilting during construction.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

